flowchart LR
  CONFIG[Externalized Configuration]
  CONFIG --> SOURCES[Configuration Sources]
  SOURCES --> DFLT[Default Properties]
  SOURCES --> APP[application.properties / .yml]
  SOURCES --> PROF[Profile-specific properties]
  SOURCES --> CMD[Command-line Arguments]
  SOURCES --> ENV[Environment Variables]
  SOURCES --> JNDI[JNDI Attributes]
  SOURCES --> SYS[System Properties]
  SOURCES --> RAND[Random Values]

  CONFIG --> PREC[Precedence Order]
  PREC --> HIGH[Highest: Command Line]
  PREC --> MID[Middle: Application Properties]
  PREC --> LOW[Lowest: Defaults]

  CONFIG --> BIND[Configuration Binding]
  BIND --> CP[ConfigurationProperties]
  BIND --> VAL[Value Injection]
  BIND --> PS[PropertySource]

  CONFIG --> FORMAT[Property Formats]
  FORMAT --> PROPS[Properties]
  FORMAT --> YAML[YAML / YML]
  FORMAT --> MDOC[Multi-document YAML]

  CONFIG --> PROFILES[Profiles]
  PROFILES --> ACTIVE[spring.profiles.active]
  PROFILES --> GROUP[spring.profiles.group]
  PROFILES --> INCLUDE[spring.profiles.include]

  CONFIG --> ADV[Advanced Features]
  ADV --> IMPORT[spring.config.import]
  ADV --> LOC[Config Location Ordering]
  ADV --> RELAX[Relaxed Binding]
  ADV --> VALIDATE[Validation at Startup]
  ADV --> CONV[Type Converters]
  ADV --> K8S[Kubernetes ConfigMaps]
